section: rts
synopsis: Fix crash in the nonmoving GC caused by racing weak pointer evacuation
issues: #23160
mrs: !16522
description:
  When two threads compete for evacuating the same ``Weak#`` object, the
  losing thread would produces an object that is never put on a weak list.
  This resulted in pointers in the object getting stale, and the nonmoving
  GC crashing trying to follow them. This is fixed by immediately marking
  the losing weak object as dead.
